---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = "How to Automate Customer Support Without Sounding Like a Robot | PresciaIQ Insights";
const description = "Customers hate chatbots that do not work. Here is how we build AI support agents that actually resolve tickets and improve customer satisfaction.";
const canonicalURL = new URL("/insights/how-to-automate-customer-support/", Astro.site).href;
const date = "2026-08-03";
const category = "AI Automations";

const schema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BlogPosting",
  "headline": title,
  "description": description,
  "image": "https://www.presciaiq.com.au/og-image.jpg",
  "author": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "PresciaIQ",
    "url": "https://www.presciaiq.com.au"
  },
  "publisher": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "PresciaIQ",
    "logo": {
      "@type": "ImageObject",
      "url": "https://www.presciaiq.com.au/logo.png"
    }
  },
  "datePublished": date,
  "dateModified": date,
  "mainEntityOfPage": {
    "@type": "WebPage",
    "@id": canonicalURL
  }
};
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} canonicalURL={canonicalURL}>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(schema)} />

  <main class="min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground py-24">
    <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mb-12">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono font-semibold text-primary border border-primary/20 bg-primary/5">{category}</span>
          <time class="text-sm text-muted-foreground font-sans">{new Date(date).toLocaleDateString('en-AU', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })}</time>
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-foreground mb-6 leading-tight">{title}</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-muted-foreground font-sans leading-relaxed">{description}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-invert prose-lg max-w-none font-sans">
        <p>The first generation of chatbots damaged the reputation of automated support. They were rigid decision trees that forced customers through frustrating loops and rarely resolved actual problems. Today's AI support agents are fundamentally different.</p><p>When PresciaIQ builds an AI support agent, we do not program responses. We provide the agent with your entire company knowledge base — past support tickets, product manuals, return policies, and internal SOPs. The agent uses this context to generate unique, accurate responses to customer queries in real-time. It understands nuance, can ask clarifying questions, and knows exactly when to escalate a complex issue to a human team member.</p><p>More importantly, these agents operate 24/7. For an Australian e-commerce brand or service business, this means customers get immediate resolution at 10 PM on a Sunday, reducing ticket backlog for your team on Monday morning and significantly improving the customer experience.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-white/10">
        <div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center">
          <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4">Ready to automate your operations?</h3>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-6">Book a scoping call with our team to discuss how custom AI automations can eliminate manual work in your business.</p>
          <a href="/start" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-primary text-primary-foreground font-semibold text-sm hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,255,136,0.3)] transition-all duration-300">
            Book a Scoping Call →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
